# A store while the music plays, when the flash write does not stop the audio (the unit's sliced erase: `seamless 1`): written at once, no fade out, no waiting.
# (Without it, `seamless 0`, the music fades out for the write, as store.amb checks.)
seed 0
wait 3000
seamless 1
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 60
expect saved 1
expect dirty 0
expect storewait 0
expect hushed 0
expect playing 1
